cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or discuss this prototype, please cite it as below."
title: "Pantograph: An Agentic CAD System That Writes Definitions, Not Objects"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Ray
    website: "https://rayzlz.com"
year: 2026
url: "https://www.pantograph.ai"
repository-code: "https://github.com/madebyrayz/Pantograph"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A research prototype of agentic CAD: natural language is translated into
  an editable parametric definition graph — nodes, parameters, edges, and
  provenance — that is performed into Rhino geometry and remains open to
  human revision. The editability of the produced definition is the thesis,
  not a feature.
